      "role": "Finite lineon verification application with validated immutable path ownership, exact matrix/scalar interfaces, bounded symbolic construction and typed case/CLI integration",
      "profile": "Exact",
      "origin": "lean4/FoliatedFracton2Gauge.lean",
      "cost": "Positions and rational input components <=4096 bits; <=4096 simultaneous hops or trajectory samples; O(n) validation and order/witness scans, intermediate positions need at most 4097 bits. Exact holonomy is fixed 2x2 with bounded shared Gaussian components. Symbolic curvature constructs one unevaluated acos or returns a fixed integral value. Default receipt has 77 obligations.",
      "groups": [
        {
          "requirement": "Admit exact positions up to 4096 bits and at most 4096 simultaneous unit hops. The frozen LineonPath owns detached nested tuple snapshots. Mathematical order/collision failure is false; malformed paths and undefined permutation parity are typed refusals.",
